{"id": "86320", "name": "גזירה סתומה – xᵐ+yⁿ=k·xy (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Use implicit differentiation to find \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\) for the graph of</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}xy \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Bring all terms to one side, differentiate with respect to \\(x\\) (the term \\(xy\\) by the product rule, powers of \\(y\\) by the chain rule), and solve for \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Rearranging</b><br><p>To find \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\) for the graph of</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}xy \\]</p><p>rearrange the equation to give</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}xy =0 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Differentiating implicitly</b><br><p>Thus</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{d}{dx}\\left(x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}xy\\right) =0 \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}{{CT:3}}+{{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}\\frac{dy}{dx}-{{CT:2}}(y+x\\frac{dy}{dx})=0 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Solving for \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\)</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx}({{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}-{{CT:2}}x) = {{CT:2}}y-{{CT:0}}{{CT:3}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{{{CT:2}}y-{{CT:0}}{{CT:3}}}{{{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}-{{CT:2}}x} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "diffp", "n1", "n2", "n3", "p", "wronganswer1"], "nvariants": 50}